    "body": "We discussed this at length in the latest WHATNOT (2026-09-17) but the conversation didn't really conclude. There were mixed opinions around exposing this, and exactly how we would without making custom elements more brittle.\n\nI think we'll continue the discussion next week (so https://github.com/whatwg/dom/labels/agenda%2B should remain) but in the interim gathering more use cases and justifications for this might also help.",
